# Cost

Prefer a serverless service when it meets the duration, payload, and packaging need. A managed service that is not serverless is allowed when it is the better tool. The ADR names the pricing unit and the serverless option that was set aside.

Stay in one region. Do not add a VPC, NAT gateway, or provisioned concurrency unless an ADR accepts the standing charge.

Demo traffic uses the CloudFront default hostname. A custom domain and a web application firewall stay off until `deployCustomDomain` is true or an ADR says otherwise.

Dev stacks use `removalPolicy: destroy`. Prod uses `retain`.
